<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_III__cl_25__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_III__cl_25__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Majlis hendaklah, sekurang-kurangnya sekali dalam tiap- tiap dua tahun, mengkaji semula perintah gaji minimum."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_III__cl_25__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_III__cl_25> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
