<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_III__cl_25__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_III__cl_25__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Jika Majlis berpuas hati bahawa apa-apa perkara yang dinyatakan dalam perintah gaji minimum perlu dipinda, seksyen 21, 22 dan 23 hendaklah terpakai."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
