<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_5__para_d> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "d" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
