<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_IV__cl_35> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_IV__cl_35__para_c> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_IV__cl_35> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_IV> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
