<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://schema.org/name> "Dalam Akta ini, melainkan jika konteksnya menghendaki makna yang lain—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/msa@> .
